      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Knock-knock, mothafucks, it's me, Mr. Clusterfuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "What, when, where, how, like who gives a fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Golf Wang M-O-B, mopping niggas ante up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Ain't been this fucking sick since brain cancer ate my Granny up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Rest in peace or lie in it, life ain't got no light in it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Darker than that closet that nigga Frankie was hiding in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Open it, dope in it, Bobby, where's my fucking pipe?",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Dress my little dick as Ike, twenty says I hit your wife",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "This is life, truthfully I just want to fly some kites",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Grab Salem and Slater and go around, riding bikes",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Get some ice cream, Golf Wang Roscoe's for the night",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "To skate around and do annoying shit that older peeps despise",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Nigga, fuck it though, going hard as riga mo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Got a nigga dollars and a couple cracker kids at shows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Cracked a couple kids in the head with this cast",
          "rhyme": "ost",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Had a blast out in Europe, had a Swedish bitch licking toes",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "That's how it goes, designing clothes",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Cats on everything, cats on everything",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "You think all this money will make a happy me?",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "But I'm 'bout as lonely as crackers that supermodels eat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Everybody's sparking but me, and I keep coughing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Can't keep calm in this spot's hot box and I'm getting nauseous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Hop in the car, ride to Saugus, and head straight to the office",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Pissed off at Jasper because that's some faggot shit called \"Pink Dolphin\"",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "(Damn) I roll here on a mean unicorn",
          "rhyme": "ORn",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Green hat, Vans, Golf top is the team uniform",
          "rhyme": "uRm",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Downing that Capri Sun, tighten my bandana up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Something like a lez, I'm forgetting my damn manners cause",
          "rhyme": "oz",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABBCDEFCGHIJJKLMNOMNPLQRSBT",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCCCDCEDCFFFCDCGDCHCIJHBF"
