        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Shit you've got to battle with, wishing they could skedaddle",
          "rhyme": "9dl",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But it makes your shadow say none, fun and grab the gun again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I needed to get out of the house",
          "rhyme": "awz",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "So I hit the Dead Sams, and we went biking it out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
