        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "In a black hoodie, with an Arizona and a bag of Skittles",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Just to see what all that fucking hype is about (RIP)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Now every time you see a roach, you think of me, ayy?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "'Cause every time I see one, I think what his parents would say",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "In court saying I ate him, I wasn't present that day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I was with Whitney smoking, sitting at the dock of the bay",
